1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,816
This is Free My ID It takes your name off the websites that sell it.

2
00:00:05,316 --> 00:00:15,866
Maybe you've seen the post: I do not give permission to use my information. The instinct is right. But that post never reaches the companies that sell your details.

3
00:00:16,366 --> 00:00:27,890
People-search sites list your home address, phone number, age and relatives, and sell them to anyone who pays. A federal consumer agency has warned that includes scammers and stalkers.

4
00:00:28,390 --> 00:00:39,602
Free My ID asks each of those sites to remove you, the way that site takes requests, and keeps checking. Here's what setup looks like. It's six short screens.

5
00:00:40,102 --> 00:00:45,160
Step one. Choose who this is for, type your name to sign, and agree.

6
00:00:45,660 --> 00:00:50,916
Step two. Their name. Add maiden or earlier names if they have any.

7
00:00:51,416 --> 00:00:55,871
Step three. Where they live. A city and state is enough.

8
00:00:56,371 --> 00:01:05,703
Step four. A few optional details, like year of birth. These only help tell them apart from people with the same name, and they're never sent to anyone.

9
00:01:06,203 --> 00:01:15,209
Step five. Pick an email service for replies. Or choose skip, and Free My ID opens each message for you to send yourself.

10
00:01:15,709 --> 00:01:21,834
Step six. Let it keep checking automatically, once a day, quietly in the background.

11
00:01:22,334 --> 00:01:28,053
That's it. It starts in practice mode, so nothing is sent until you say so.

12
00:01:28,553 --> 00:01:36,920
When you're ready, turn on real requests in Settings. If a website ever needs a real person, a card appears with one big button.

13
00:01:37,420 --> 00:01:46,729
No account. No cloud. It never asks for your Social Security number, bank, or card details. Your records stay on your computer.

14
00:01:47,229 --> 00:01:57,175
Some sites take weeks, and some list people again later. That's why it keeps checking, and it always shows you which sites confirmed and which are still waiting.

15
00:01:57,675 --> 00:02:03,312
Free My ID is free and open source. The download link is below this video.
